  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "華語教材教法",
    "sub_ename": "INSTRUCTIONAL MATERIALS AND METHODS FOR TCSL",
    "describe_ch": "培養未來華語教師之教學能力，內容包含(1)第二語教學法理論基礎、教學法適應對象與時機，及教材教法評估；(2)探討如何選用合適教材、設計教案與教具、運用教學法，及施行多元評量模式；(3)以「成果導向」設計華語聽說讀寫教材和教法，並評估教學成效；(4)善用網路資源於教學中。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is for the prospective teachers of TCSL as preparation for their future career. The contents include (1) introduction to pedagogical theories, when and to whom the pedagogy should be practiced, and the assessment of instructional materials and methods; (2) the selection and exploitation of textbooks, the planning of lessons, the application of pedagogy, and the enforcement of multiple assessment; (3) the design of outcome-based teaching materials for Chinese linguistics , assessing language skills, and the workshop of teaching; (4) the employment of online resources.",
